+ * olai patch (session-list-info) — two facts a `session/list` entry has on
+ * disk that ACP's SessionInfo has no field for: HOW BIG the conversation is
+ * (`messageCount`), and WHICH session clearing it brought the session that
+ * replaced it about (`supersededBy`, attached to the OLDER row).
